WEBVTT

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:43.967
Come to me now, crown prince
of the Jurai royal family.

00:01:43.967 --> 00:01:47.130
Come face me and taste
the blood of your defeat.

00:01:52.709 --> 00:01:54.277
No, Tenchi.

00:01:54.277 --> 00:01:56.006
It is too dangerous here.

00:02:19.603 --> 00:02:21.038
Now, that's pathetic.

00:02:21.038 --> 00:02:23.302
You weaklings are no match for Nagi.

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:38.955
Just like old times.

00:02:38.955 --> 00:02:41.591
This place hasn't changed a bit.

00:02:41.591 --> 00:02:43.081
Yeah.

00:02:44.061 --> 00:02:45.462
That's strange.

00:02:45.462 --> 00:02:47.898
They don't seem to have
any security guards here, huh?

00:02:47.898 --> 00:02:50.067
That's because they don't
have any need for them.

00:02:50.067 --> 00:02:51.234
Huh?

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:52.669
Don't you see?

00:02:52.669 --> 00:02:55.972
There's absolutely no one in this
universe that can harm the emperor of Jurai.

00:02:55.972 --> 00:03:00.377
Indeed. Jurai's emperor controls
the most power in the universe.

00:03:00.377 --> 00:03:03.480
Also, all the previous emperors of Jurai

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:06.813
have always had the most powerful knights
like ourselves, around to protect them.

00:03:08.185 --> 00:03:10.710
You see? There's one now.

00:03:17.894 --> 00:03:21.631
Oh. Guess I can't fool the
knight of the royal court.

00:03:21.631 --> 00:03:23.500
Never thought I'd see you two in person.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:26.937
You must be a knight in service
under the current emperor of Jurai.

00:03:26.937 --> 00:03:28.105
That's right.

00:03:28.105 --> 00:03:30.040
I am Tetta.

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:34.377
Then listen up, Tetta. This is the
rightful crown prince of the planet Jurai.

00:03:34.377 --> 00:03:37.314
Yeah? So what?

00:03:37.314 --> 00:03:40.917
I see. You knew that already, of course.

00:03:40.917 --> 00:03:43.019
Well, then there's nothing more to say.

00:03:43.019 --> 00:03:45.188
When you serve a villain,
you are not a true knight,

00:03:45.188 --> 00:03:48.125
and it's my duty to bring
punishment down upon you.

00:03:48.125 --> 00:03:50.193
Please proceed, Your Highness.

00:03:50.193 --> 00:03:51.828
And, Kamidake, guard him well.

00:03:51.828 --> 00:03:53.318
Right.

00:03:56.399 --> 00:03:59.334
Stop... right there.

00:04:01.138 --> 00:04:03.629
And now, rebel scum, you deal with me.

00:04:24.394 --> 00:04:26.830
Let's hurry and move the fleet now.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.766
Have the Jurai power force field
satellites ready and await my order.

00:04:42.612 --> 00:04:44.170
What is this?

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:47.884
Stay right there.

00:04:47.884 --> 00:04:50.720
- When all ships take their positions...
- Hi.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.722
Well, since we have a
heated battle going on here

00:04:52.722 --> 00:04:55.458
we thought we should check
up on you see how you're doing.

00:04:55.458 --> 00:04:57.427
Just what are you?

00:04:57.427 --> 00:05:01.898
What I am is Washu, the best
scientific genius in the universe.

00:05:01.898 --> 00:05:05.202
I've got this station under siege, Admiral.

00:05:05.202 --> 00:05:08.638
You'd better order that
battle fleet of yours to stop.

00:05:08.638 --> 00:05:10.073
And do it right now,

00:05:10.073 --> 00:05:14.644
or I'll inject my homemade
supercomputer virus into your system.

00:05:14.644 --> 00:05:16.271
What do you mean?

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:21.985
It will destroy the battle tactics
program of Jurai's entire military system.

00:05:21.985 --> 00:05:24.087
Close off all circuits immediately. Hurry.

00:05:24.087 --> 00:05:24.921
Yes, Sir. Right away.

00:05:24.921 --> 00:05:27.357
I don't think so. It's too late for that.

00:05:27.357 --> 00:05:30.126
Start the self-destruct
program for that station.

00:05:30.126 --> 00:05:31.428
Right away, Sir.

00:05:31.428 --> 00:05:33.293
What?! A self-destruct program?!

00:05:42.606 --> 00:05:44.733
All right. Be that way.

00:05:45.308 --> 00:05:46.810
Suck on this!

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:48.937
Come on. You gotta get outta here.

00:06:07.364 --> 00:06:09.566
The whole system's out of control!

00:06:09.566 --> 00:06:10.667
It doesn't work!

00:06:10.667 --> 00:06:13.403
Attention all ships that have
escaped the effects of the virus.

00:06:13.403 --> 00:06:16.270
Track down the enemy and destroy them.

00:06:36.259 --> 00:06:37.749
What?!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.127
That's not bad.

00:07:00.850 --> 00:07:02.511
Lord Tenchi!

00:07:07.824 --> 00:07:09.314
Kamidake!

00:07:20.203 --> 00:07:21.471
Kamidake?

00:07:21.471 --> 00:07:23.496
He is quite strong.

00:07:24.441 --> 00:07:27.577
The throne room is just ahead of us.

00:07:27.577 --> 00:07:29.979
Let me deal with this one.

00:07:29.979 --> 00:07:32.345
Just go ahead, Lord Tenchi!

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:49.032
Tenchi, go now, quick!

00:07:49.032 --> 00:07:50.693
Okay, right.

00:07:56.206 --> 00:07:58.436
What's your name, warrior?

00:07:59.075 --> 00:08:01.066
I'm Tessei.

00:08:03.246 --> 00:08:07.283
Is that all a legendary knight can do?

00:08:07.283 --> 00:08:11.879
You know, given that performance,
you'd have been better off sleeping forever.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:44.120
Wh-What was that?

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:46.022
It's Jurai's needle.

00:08:46.022 --> 00:08:49.014
The skill was not yet
available during your time.

00:09:19.789 --> 00:09:20.824
Tenchi!

00:09:20.824 --> 00:09:22.849
Ayeka!

00:09:27.997 --> 00:09:30.830
Hello, there.

00:09:34.404 --> 00:09:39.609
Hmm. They sure are persistent.

00:09:39.609 --> 00:09:41.811
Guess I should get going.

00:09:41.811 --> 00:09:43.642
Let's go!

00:09:52.255 --> 00:09:53.916
Fire now!

00:09:58.795 --> 00:10:00.626
See ya!

00:10:12.375 --> 00:10:14.605
I've been looking forward to meeting you.

00:10:23.119 --> 00:10:24.687
Sword Tenchi.

00:10:24.687 --> 00:10:27.257
Well, I guess you must
be in the legitimate line,

00:10:27.257 --> 00:10:29.392
but only if you are able to use it.

00:10:29.392 --> 00:10:31.961
I couldn't care less
about that family tree.

00:10:31.961 --> 00:10:34.931
What I do care about
is taking Ayeka with me.

00:10:34.931 --> 00:10:36.699
You have nothing to worry about.

00:10:36.699 --> 00:10:40.931
All you have to do is defeat me,
and you can do whatever you want.

00:10:49.646 --> 00:10:52.012
So kill me.

00:11:11.568 --> 00:11:14.162
Oh, no! Tenchi!

00:11:45.976 --> 00:11:48.145
Tenchi.

00:11:58.155 --> 00:12:00.366
You've disappointed me, you know.

00:12:00.366 --> 00:12:06.372
Your sword is weak, and I thought the
Jurai power would be so much greater.

00:12:06.372 --> 00:12:09.291
I can't believe you're not more capable.

00:12:16.006 --> 00:12:22.179
Tenchi! Tenchiiii!

00:12:24.598 --> 00:12:30.563
You are pretty good, but you're
not good enough to defeat us.

00:12:30.563 --> 00:12:36.193
You see, both you and your master
are missing one important attribute.

00:12:36.193 --> 00:12:39.989
What you are missing is the
noble spirit that respects chivalry,

00:12:39.989 --> 00:12:43.868
without which you don't deserve to be
called knight let alone Jurai's emperor.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:46.495
Who cares?

00:12:46.495 --> 00:12:49.081
You still don't get it, do you?

00:13:05.973 --> 00:13:09.894
See? You simply didn't
deserve to be a Jurai knight.

00:13:29.622 --> 00:13:31.415
Take this!

00:13:34.668 --> 00:13:36.253
I missed?!

00:14:32.142 --> 00:14:33.978
You're hurt, Kiyone.

00:14:33.978 --> 00:14:36.313
All right, we surrender! We give up!

00:14:36.313 --> 00:14:39.274
It looks like this is as far as we can go.

00:14:39.274 --> 00:14:42.319
I think you're right.
And now the rest is up to Tenchi.

00:14:43.028 --> 00:14:45.698
You can do it, Tenchi.

00:14:56.500 --> 00:14:57.876
How pathetic.

00:14:57.876 --> 00:15:01.797
And you, a direct descendent
of Jurai's royal family.

00:15:02.881 --> 00:15:04.091
What is it...

00:15:04.091 --> 00:15:06.468
What is it that you want?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:13.308
Well, what do you think I want?

00:15:13.308 --> 00:15:19.148
I want an end to the direct
bloodline of Jurai's royal family.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:32.327
Ayeka?!

00:15:34.747 --> 00:15:38.167
I will not allow you to kill Tenchi.

00:15:38.167 --> 00:15:41.128
You finally evoked Jurai's power, eh?

00:15:47.176 --> 00:15:50.721
It's all my fault, Tenchi.

00:15:50.721 --> 00:15:55.184
I'm so sorry this has happened
and it's all because of me.

00:15:55.184 --> 00:15:57.186
Ayeka.

00:15:58.437 --> 00:16:01.732
Kagato, I'm warning you,
move away from Tenchi now.

00:16:08.447 --> 00:16:10.949
Better luck next time.

00:16:16.163 --> 00:16:17.706
No!

00:16:30.928 --> 00:16:34.139
S-Stop it, Kagato!

00:16:36.683 --> 00:16:41.814
You won't harm Ayeka!

00:16:44.316 --> 00:16:46.318
What?

00:17:02.626 --> 00:17:04.586
What is happening?

00:17:04.586 --> 00:17:07.131
Uhh.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:20.394
Huh? What's this?

00:17:27.276 --> 00:17:30.737
This is the way the Earth looks.

00:17:30.737 --> 00:17:32.239
That's right.

00:17:32.239 --> 00:17:39.121
Tenchi, as successor to both the spirit of
Jurai, and of Earth, you can do this task.

00:17:40.956 --> 00:17:43.750
I see it. I can see it.

00:17:44.042 --> 00:17:47.462
Ayeka and Tenchi.

00:17:47.462 --> 00:17:49.840
I have the same vision, too.

00:18:19.953 --> 00:18:22.873
So I see. That is Jurai's true power.

00:18:22.873 --> 00:18:26.293
Does this mean that Jurai
has chosen its own master, then?

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:15.193
Yosho, looks like I've lost again, doesn't it?

00:20:41.845 --> 00:20:43.972
You did it, Tenchi.

00:20:56.443 --> 00:20:59.613
Tenchi!

00:21:32.687 --> 00:21:34.398
And so Kagato, the man who claimed

00:21:34.398 --> 00:21:37.901
to be the emperor and king of
planet Jurai had been vanquished.

00:21:37.901 --> 00:21:44.366
Ayeka was safe and sound, and as for me...

00:23:34.267 --> 00:23:37.646
Oh, Tenchi, isn't it so nice?

00:23:37.646 --> 00:23:40.315
It's like a carnival every day.

00:23:40.315 --> 00:23:43.860
I wish these days could go on
just like this forever and ever.

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:45.362
Tenchi.

00:23:45.362 --> 00:23:47.822
Oh, those days were like
a never-ending carnival,

00:23:47.822 --> 00:23:52.369
a crazy circus we thought would last forever.

00:23:52.369 --> 00:23:55.872
It all started one day.

00:23:55.872 --> 00:23:58.375
Next episode is: "No Need for a Conclusion!"

00:23:58.375 --> 00:24:01.962
It's unquestionably the final episode.
